1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,360
Welcome to the Grotta del Buemirino, one of the most extraordinary places in the Gulf of Oroce.

2
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:12,560
Before beginning the tour, it is essential to know and respect the visiting rules.

3
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:19,440
They are in place to protect you and this unique, fragile, and millennia-old environment.

4
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:26,240
The visit will last approximately 50 minutes. The route runs along a single walkway accessible

5
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:32,800
to everyone, covering approximately one kilometer on the way in and one kilometer on the way back.

6
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:39,120
Push chairs are permitted and wheelchairs can be used for the entire route. The path is linear and

7
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:45,760
has no branches open to the public. It is, however, very important to respect the timing.

8
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:51,040
Within 50 minutes, you must be back outside the cave in order to board the vessel that will

9
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:57,120
take you to your next destination. For this reason, it is essential to keep up with the guide's pace

10
00:00:57,120 --> 00:01:03,120
and not fall too far behind. Stopping for too long along the route could compromise the timing

11
00:01:03,120 --> 00:01:09,120
of the visit and risk missing the boat. By working together and maintaining a steady pace,

12
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:15,120
everyone will be able to enjoy the experience calmly and in full. The cave is an extremely

13
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:22,720
delicate ecosystem. Do not touch the stalactites and stalagmites. Even a simple touch can interrupt

14
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:29,120
a growth process that takes thousands of years. Do not collect anything and do not leave any litter.

15
00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:36,480
Every element here has scientific and naturalistic value. Follow only the walkways and the marked

16
00:01:36,480 --> 00:01:42,560
route. Leaving the authorized areas is not permitted. This ensures your safety and protects

17
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:49,440
the limestone formations. Keep your voice low. The cave amplifies sounds and a quiet environment

18
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:56,000
allows everyone to enjoy a truly evocative and authentic experience. Smoking is not permitted.

19
00:01:56,640 --> 00:02:02,720
Open flames are strictly forbidden. Photography is allowed, but the use of camera flash is

20
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:08,800
prohibited. In addition to potentially disturbing the balance of the underground environment,

21
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:15,280
the flash compromises the quality of the visit itself. In a naturally dark space like the cave,

22
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:21,440
sudden artificial light alters the atmosphere, creates strong visual pollution,

23
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:27,680
and breaks the spell of shadows, silence, and reflections on the water that makes the experience

24
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:34,960
unique. The guide is responsible for your safety. Listen carefully to the instructions,

25
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:39,360
especially in the narrower sections or where the ground is wet.

26
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:47,200
The Grotta del Buemirino is a precious natural heritage site. Your respect is an integral part

27
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:52,320
of the experience. Thank you for your cooperation and enjoy your visit.

